<title>USA: Kent Electronics Dec. 28 Q3 net drops.</title>
<headline>Kent Electronics Dec. 28 Q3 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>KENT ELECTRONICS CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		     CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF EARNINGS(a)</p>
<p>			   Third Quarter		   Nine Months</p>
<p>		    (Thirteen Weeks)	    (Thirty-Nine Weeks)</p>
<p>	 December 28,   December 30,  December 28,  December 30,</p>
<p>	     1996	     1995	    1996	    1995</p>
<p>Net sales</p>
<p>	$106,385,000   $100,059,000  $314,906,000  $267,834,000</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>	 $ 6,635,000    $ 8,253,000   $22,136,000  $ 18,950,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>		  $.26	     $.33	    $.87	    $.85</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p> shares 25,404,300     25,098,800    25,343,000    22,225,900</p>
<p>NOTE: The Company's common stock was split 2-for-1 to stockholders of record on February 15, 1996, and was effected as a 100% stock dividend.  All issued and outstanding shares and earnings per share amounts have been restated to give effect to the stock split.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
